● TASK RESULT
Fixed 4 bugs in the Fearless War Room Step 5a roster self-scout:
### Changes
- **Bug 1 – Wrong denominators**: In `pipeline/build_roster.py`, champion `picks.of` and `by_bucket.<G>.picks.of` now use the **top player's own game count** instead of the union of all roster games. Added `sample.per_player` dict with per-player `{games, by_bucket}`. `top.picks` labels likewise use per-player bucket counts.
- **Bug 2 – Default opponent**: Added `defaultOpponent(usId, teams)` pure helper in `web/src/roster.js` that excludes both `"c9-2027"` and `"47351"` from auto-selection, preferring the first LCS 2026 team. Updated `App.jsx` to use it.
- **Bug 3 – Roster pools card**: `ScoutPanel.jsx` now renders the roster pools card and flag badges whenever **either side** is c9-2027 (not just when it's the opponent). Added `usTeamId`/`oppTeamId` props.
- **Bug 4 – Mobile layout**: Added `@media (max-width: 600px)` rules for `.matchup` (column layout), `.roster-toggle`, `.roster-badge`, `.badge`, and `.roster-table` to prevent overflow at 412px.
### Verification
- `python3 pipeline/build_roster.py` ✓ – Vi: "18/142" (was "18/231"), Orianna: "11/96" (was "11/231")
- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v` ✓ – 32/32 passed (4 new denominator tests added)
- `cd web && npx vitest run` ✓ – 62/62 passed (8 new defaultOpponent tests added)
- `cd web && npx vite build --outDir /tmp/wb/dist` ✓ – clean build, then `rm -rf web/dist`
### Notes
- No commits made per instructions.
- ResourceWarnings in build_model.py are pre-existing and out of scope.
